<!--/VOLSTEP--></div><div class="obs" id="claim-cycle-32b6421ff34a6fa0"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-observation">观察</span><span class="claim-source">荐票 · 结论</span></div><div class="obs-watch"><p class="mut">荐票 · 结论</p><p>周期路只提供环境级攻防开关，不荐个股。</p></div></div><div class="obs" id="claim-cycle-767ad9294a33dcb6"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-observation">观察</span><span class="claim-source">荐票 · 标的</span></div><div class="obs-watch"><p class="mut">荐票 · 标的</p><p>[]</p></div></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-9ac5a9a42ebac8ea"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-1f923ee1c0ac7261"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><h3>量能1.9005万亿未达2万亿档，五路3票（启动2、高潮1）· 弃权2，环境维持B档审慎参与</h3></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-7a8863d93eee3268"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>量能台阶→先行指标三窗→五路周期投票→连板梯队→攻防总开关。周期路只做环境判定，不荐个股、不写交易计划。</p></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-620a1ac71cc53b5b"></span><span id="claim-cycle-81a6c6f1b4ba71fb"></span><span id="claim-cycle-bd80346a41e76676"></span><span id="claim-cycle-6eaf8315cb8d8f12"></span><span id="claim-cycle-d6f16c8de88fce81"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-059c0c380af3fa56"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>↘台阶未过2万亿两市量能19005.0亿两市成交额19005.0亿元，约1.9005万亿元；不满足3.3万亿看多或3.5万亿主升门槛</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-8af68e28c27b1cc4"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>◷主判·平情绪阶段启动温度49.6中性；涨停69、炸板14、跌停8、炸板率0.169%、封板率0.8313%</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-a2797195e09ac98a"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>♨中性市场温度49.6冰点偏冷中性偏热过热温度49.6、中性</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-bdb26a134d7d7eee"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>⌁总仓位上限4成执行状态B档审慎参与置信度67/100（未校准评分）；启动/平；有活跃度但阶段梯队与主线证据不支持进攻升级。</p></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-f6c56975934a4fe7"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-e6206549ea881b6c"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>两市成交额19005.0亿元，约1.9005万亿元；未达到2万亿元档，也明显高于3万亿元退潮线所指的3万亿口径。按规则表处于1.7至2.0万亿元之间，但非2万亿以上；支持有承载，不满足3.3万亿看多或3.5万亿主升门槛。相邻前一记录20261008的温度表成交额为null，量能序列只有目标日可用值，不能判断放量/缩量趋势。</p></div></section><section id="leading"><h2>二 先行指标 · 三窗触发器</h2><div id="component-LEADIND"><!--LEADIND--><div class="card"><p style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:2px">情绪先行指标 · 近20日 <span class="mut" style="font-weight:400">(脚本段A档 · 情绪先行指标.py --card · 当日温度 —,阈值冰点&lt;25/过热≥85)</span></p><div style="font-size:11px;color:#6b7683">涨停数_净=69</div><svg viewBox="0 0 880 196" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block"><line x1="46" y1="172" x2="866" y2="172" stroke="#3a3f46"></line><line x1="46" y1="143.0" x2="866" y2="143.0" stroke="#8a6d2f" stroke-dasharray="4 4" stroke-width="0.8"></line><text x="866" y="140.0" font-size="8.5" fill="#8a6d2f" text-anchor="end">1进2率10%=接力冰点参考线</text><rect x="55.8" y="51.0" width="21.3" height="121.0" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"></rect><text x="66.5" y="48" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">82</text><rect x="96.8" y="42.1" width="21.3" height="129.9" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"></rect><text x="107.5" y="39" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">88</text><rect x="137.8" y="49.5" width="21.3" height="122.5" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"></rect><text x="148.5" y="47" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">83</text><rect x="178.8" y="95.3" width="21.3" height="76.7" rx="1.5" fill="#4a5666"></rect><text x="189.5" y="92" font-size="8" fill="#6b7683" text-anchor="middle">52</text><rect x="2