</div><!--/VOTEBOARD--><!--/MACHVOTE--></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-0ecb7a27d23d6e45"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-8c4d54d69f8ce192"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>市场情绪：温度49.6、中性；涨停69、炸板14、炸板率16.9%、跌停8、封板率83.13%、回封26、二板加12、最高板9。涨停广度与封板质量较好，跌停未达两位数退潮线；封板率越过80%提示分化风险，但不单独等于高潮。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-cbedc6311ad11e2f"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>五路周期票：有效票3、弃权2：theme=启动/平74，logic=启动/平68，limitup=高潮/降80；auction、lhb弃权。阶段票启动2、高潮1；方向票平2、降1。弃权不计票。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-2ed23bc2d5690f57"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>独立裁决：主判启动/平，置信度67。交易活跃、温度中性、涨停扩散及低位首进二支持启动；成交额未跨3万亿/3.3万亿门槛、二进三率为0、梯队3板缺档、题材缺A档及主线确认，限制上修为发酵主升；封板率83.13%与limitup的高潮/降警示分化风险，因此方向不判升。环境开关为B档审慎参与、总仓位上限4成。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-d5d06a0ceb47e817"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>题材与主线：题材归位覆盖69/69，A/B/C=0/69/0；聚类6有9行最高仅3/6，行业口径电池6只4/6也不能替代题材聚类主线证据。固态电池宽3、高4，机器人宽2、高5；存在分支活跃与高标，但尚无明确主线确认。</p></div></section><section id="ladder"><h2>四 连板梯队</h2><div id="component-LADDER"><!--LADDER-->
<div class="card"><h3 style="margin:0 0 8px">连板梯队 <span class="hint">机器核对 · 涨停池连板数分布(涨停池 69 只(zt_pool全口径,含ST))</span></h3><div class="cols"><div class="col hotc"><i style="height:4%"></i><b>1</b><span>9板</span></div>
<div class="col"><i style="height:4%"></i><b>2</b><span>5板</span></div>
<div class="col"><i style="height:4%"></i><b>1</b><span>4板</span></div>
<div class="col"><i style="height:14%"></i><b>8</b><span>2板</span></div>
<div class="col"><i style="height:100%"></i><b>57</b><span>1板</span></div>
</div><div class="colsub"><span>最高9板=新华传媒 出版(9/9,092500首封)</span><span>腰部: 2板8只 / 3板0只 / 4板+4只</span><span>首板57占82% · 涨停池 69 只(zt_pool全口径,含ST)</span></div>
<p style="margin:6px 0 0" class="mut">温度表涨停69只 · 炸板率16.9%</p></div>

<!--/LADDER--></div><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-dc4b2d3c0516802e"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-5b87e2450d163873"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>涨停池69只，连板分布9板1、5板2、4板1、2板8、首板57；3板缺档，4至5板承接薄，高标孤立。强广度与高度并存但中段不连续，暂不足以判发酵主升。</p></div></section><section id="position"><h2>五 攻防 · 仓位总开关</h2><div class="card"><span id="claim-cycle-7382d2e1333c9ddc"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-1dc65598394a5bf1"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>B档审慎参与｜启动/平；有活跃度但阶段梯队与主线证据不支持进攻升级。｜仓位上限：总仓位上限4成｜环境级中性偏谨慎，低吸优先；不荐个股、不写买卖计划。封板率越过80%分化锚，避免追一致高位。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-855d46e19ad8b260"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>禁项：</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-fd19c17fe93b8ab1"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><li>不将成交额19005亿元写成2万亿元以上或3万亿元强势门槛已满足。</li></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-55ab53ccc78c6f58"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><li>不把空缺的昨停溢价和触发器补成数值或已触发窗口。</li></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-89c46b1dc598306c"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><li>不把封板率83.13%单项等同高潮，也不把9板孤高标等同主升。</li></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-07d3470524ee1b80"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><li>不把弃权票计入阶段或方向票数。</li></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-8315feaa8a3ef3db"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><li>不将环境判断改写成个股荐票或买卖指令。</li></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-0faf67f5e14d22f5"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><p>明日观察条件：</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-9688d444ef456846"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><li>继续核对量能是否跨越3万亿元及3.3万亿元规则门槛，同时查看温度、跌停和封板质量是否同步改善。</li></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-ad01855ba2eb0662"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><li>观察3板缺档能否由真实梯队填补、二进三率是否恢复；仅有高标延续不足以证明周期升档。</li></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-5bee0a0e58ecec19"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-evidence">证据</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><li>观察是否出现同一题材聚类的公告A档催化、宽度和多层梯队共振；未核实前不确认主线。</li></div></section><section id="research"><h2>六 自主深挖 · 指标与阈值孵化</h2><div class="card"><div class="" id="claim-cycle-90ae709b54855a3e"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">深挖</span></div><p class="mut">深挖</p><p>观察阈值孵化：用3板缺档与二进三率0作为中位接力风险观察项；只有连续数据支持后再固定阈值，不将单日异常当作稳健指标。</p></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-9cbb83437556b032"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">深挖</span></div><p class="mut">深挖</p><p>复核封板率83.13%的双重含义：当日封板质量较好，同时规则表将80%作为分化风险锚；需结合下一交易日真实变化结算，不将其单独解释为方向信号。</p></div><span id="claim-cycle-34a7f21941f6b2ab"></span></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-f39a0498dd854c58"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><li>观察阈值孵化：用3板缺档与二进三率0作为中位接力风险观察项；只有连续数据支持后再固定阈值，不将单日异常当作稳健指标。</li></div><div class="" id="claim-cycle-39deb2f033258f42"><div class="claim-head"><span class="claim-role role-research">研究</span><span class="claim-source">旧版原文补充</span></div><li>复核封板率83.13%的双重含义：当日封板质量较好，同时规则表将80%作为分化风险锚；需结合下一交易日真实变化结算，不将其单独解释为方向信号。</li></div></section><section id="cognition"><h2>七 我的认知迭代 · 最